{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"99065","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/99065","key":"MC-250034","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"08/Apr/22 7:43 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>Relates to \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-120611\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-120611\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Player stuck in grass path when it changes to dirt\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-120611\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>If the player (or probably any other entity) is standing on top of a mud block as soon as that mud block becomes clay via the dripstone mechanic, the player will fall into the clay block. If there are no blocks around that clay block, this can additionally cause them to be pushed out of it sideways.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Place mud</li>\n\t<li>Place a block below the mud</li>\n\t<li>Place a stalactite below the block</li>\n\t<li>Stand on the mud</li>\n\t<li>Wait or set randomTickSpeed to a high value</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresults\"></a>Expected results</h3>\n<p>As the mud converts to clay, the player would be moved upwards slightly to accommodate the clay block's hitbox, as is done for farmland that becomes dirt.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Actualresults\"></a>Actual results</h3>\n<p>The player is not moved upwards and falls into the clay as a result.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Codeanalysis\"></a>Code analysis</h3>\n<p>Code analysis by <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=Avoma\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Avoma</a> can be found in <a href=\"https://bugs.mojang.com/browse/MC-250034?focusedCommentId=1166846&amp;page=com.atlassian.jira.plugin.system.issuetabpanels:comment-tabpanel#comment-1166846\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">this comment</a>.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"08/Apr/22 3:33 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/129824","id":"129824","filename":"2022-04-08_15.39.09.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"muzikbike","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Dublin","accountType":"customer"},"created":"08/Apr/22 7:43 AM","size":"269 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/129824","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/129824"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/129825","id":"129825","filename":"2022-04-08_15.39.13.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.